flowchart LR
    client["User / Console / pipectl"] -->|HTTP JSON + upload| api["Go API"]
    api -->|authoritative metadata| postgres[("PostgreSQL")]
    api -->|immutable upload| source[("MinIO datasets")]
    api -->|queued event| events[("RabbitMQ events")]
    scheduler["Go scheduler"] -->|lease + fenced command| postgres
    scheduler -->|processing.job.requested| commands[("RabbitMQ commands")]
    worker["Python worker"] -->|consume command| commands
    worker -->|read source| source
    worker -->|artifact.created + lifecycle| events
    result["Go result consumer"] -->|consume outcomes| events
    result -->|inbox + state + artifact metadata| postgres
    result -->|canonical report| artifacts[("MinIO artifacts")]
